{"id":"twitter:1978966966682390923","tweet_id":"1978966966682390923","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1978966966682390923","title":"@PlantsGardener @ClaudiaWolfgang @FoxNews No. I was saying an individual can be charged under Title 18 for terrorist acts. But you can't charge someon","summary":"@PlantsGardener @ClaudiaWolfgang @FoxNews No. I was saying an individual can be charged under Title 18 for terrorist acts. But you can't charge someone for membership or speech in support of terrorism. No law to do it.","date":"2025-10-16","published":"2025-10-16T23:31:06+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/PlantsGardener/status/1978961784192082008","reply_tweet_id":"1978961784192082008","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PlantsGardener @ClaudiaWolfgang @FoxNews No. I was saying an individual can be charged under Title 18 for terrorist acts.<br><br>But you can&#x27;t charge someone for membership or speech in support of terrorism.<br><br>No law to do it.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1978966966682390923","display_date":"October 16, 2025 · 23:31 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
