{"id":"twitter:1978955722877485406","tweet_id":"1978955722877485406","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1978955722877485406","title":"@PlantsGardener @ClaudiaWolfgang @FoxNews Ever wonder why the KKK was never considered a domestic terrorist organization? No statute in American law t","summary":"@PlantsGardener @ClaudiaWolfgang @FoxNews Ever wonder why the KKK was never considered a domestic terrorist organization? No statute in American law to declare a domestic group a terrorist organization. You can say and cheer terrorism till your heart's content Free speech You can't act on those beliefs. Terrorist.","date":"2025-10-16","published":"2025-10-16T22:46:26+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/PlantsGardener/status/1978953345080480204","reply_tweet_id":"1978953345080480204","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PlantsGardener @ClaudiaWolfgang @FoxNews Ever wonder why the KKK was never considered a domestic terrorist organization?<br><br>No statute in American law to declare a domestic group a terrorist organization.<br><br>You can say and cheer terrorism till your heart&#x27;s content<br><br>Free speech<br><br>You can&#x27;t act on those beliefs.<br><br>Terrorist.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1978955722877485406","display_date":"October 16, 2025 · 22:46 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
