{"id":"twitter:1978946567378780286","tweet_id":"1978946567378780286","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1978946567378780286","title":"@PlantsGardener @ClaudiaWolfgang @FoxNews You can't declare domestic groups as terrorist orgs. You can charge individuals for supporting terrorism. Yo","summary":"@PlantsGardener @ClaudiaWolfgang @FoxNews You can't declare domestic groups as terrorist orgs. You can charge individuals for supporting terrorism. You can charge a conspiracy. You can charge material support There might be more at the trial but the indictment included very little proof of a so called Antifa","date":"2025-10-16","published":"2025-10-16T22:10:03+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/PlantsGardener/status/1978946029601874212","reply_tweet_id":"1978946029601874212","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PlantsGardener @ClaudiaWolfgang @FoxNews You can&#x27;t declare domestic groups as terrorist orgs. You can charge individuals for supporting terrorism.<br><br>You can charge a conspiracy. You can charge material support<br><br>There might be more at the trial but the indictment included very little proof of a so called  Antifa</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1978946567378780286","display_date":"October 16, 2025 · 22:10 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
