{"id":"twitter:1978942852303380579","tweet_id":"1978942852303380579","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1978942852303380579","title":"@ClaudiaWolfgang @PlantsGardener @FoxNews not based on the graffiti, these weren't anti-government Faketriot militias now were they \"Antifa\" evidence ","summary":"@ClaudiaWolfgang @PlantsGardener @FoxNews not based on the graffiti, these weren't anti-government Faketriot militias now were they \"Antifa\" evidence is still quite scant","date":"2025-10-16","published":"2025-10-16T21:55:17+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/ClaudiaWolfgang/status/1978942432793297303","reply_tweet_id":"1978942432793297303","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@ClaudiaWolfgang @PlantsGardener @FoxNews not based on the graffiti, these weren&#x27;t anti-government Faketriot militias<br><br>now were they &quot;Antifa&quot;<br><br>evidence is still quite scant</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1978942852303380579","display_date":"October 16, 2025 · 21:55 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1978913940777074692","tweet_id":"1978913940777074692","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1978913940777074692","title":"These were bad people doing bad things, but I don't see much evidence in the indictment tying them to a specific Antifa Cell There are no conspiracy c","summary":"These were bad people doing bad things, but I don't see much evidence in the indictment tying them to a specific Antifa Cell There are no conspiracy charges beyond material support https://static.foxnews.com/foxnews.com/content/uploads/2025/10/prairieland-texas-ice-attack-antifa-material-support-terrorism-indictment.pdf","date":"2025-10-16","published":"2025-10-16T20:00:24+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>These were bad people doing bad things, but I don&#x27;t see much evidence in the indictment tying them to a specific Antifa Cell<br><br>There are no conspiracy charges beyond material support<br><br><a href=\"https://static.foxnews.com/foxnews.com/content/uploads/2025/10/prairieland-texas-ice-attack-antifa-material-support-terrorism-indictment.pdf\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://static.foxnews.com/foxnews.com/content/uploads/2025/10/prairieland-texas-ice-attack-antifa-material-support-terrorism-indictment.pdf</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1978913940777074692","display_date":"October 16, 2025 · 20:00 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1978913530679038383","tweet_id":"1978913530679038383","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1978913530679038383","title":"What is most interesting is you have material support charges to terrorist but you don't see any conspiracy related charges I also don't see much evid","summary":"What is most interesting is you have material support charges to terrorist but you don't see any conspiracy related charges I also don't see much evidence presented in the indictment about the group identifying as Antifa Those details maybe withheld from the encrypted chat https://x.com/PlantsGardener/status/1978912497630412955","date":"2025-10-16","published":"2025-10-16T19:58:46+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>What is most interesting is you have material support charges to terrorist<br><br>but you don&#x27;t see any conspiracy related charges <br><br>I also don&#x27;t see much evidence presented in the indictment about the group identifying as Antifa<br><br>Those details maybe withheld from the encrypted chat <a href=\"https://x.com/PlantsGardener/status/1978912497630412955\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/PlantsGardener/status/1978912497630412955</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1978913530679038383","display_date":"October 16, 2025 · 19:58 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
