{"id":"twitter:1978865339648688391","tweet_id":"1978865339648688391","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1978865339648688391","title":"@Matthew_Coman @SpaghettiKozak Yes, and I think people who aren't W Wed to the narratology of the games like it better. If you expect the storyline to","summary":"@Matthew_Coman @SpaghettiKozak Yes, and I think people who aren't W Wed to the narratology of the games like it better. If you expect the storyline to match the franchise, it doesn't. It's decent sci-fi show in the \"Halo Universe\" more than Halo. They had to add some supporting characters, some are weird.","date":"2025-10-16","published":"2025-10-16T16:47:17+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/Matthew_Coman/status/1978863603991056567","reply_tweet_id":"1978863603991056567","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Matthew_Coman @SpaghettiKozak Yes, and I think people who aren&#x27;t W<br>Wed to the narratology of the games like it better.<br><br>If you expect the storyline to match the franchise, it doesn&#x27;t.<br><br>It&#x27;s decent sci-fi show in the &quot;Halo Universe&quot; more than Halo.<br><br>They had to add some supporting characters, some are weird.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1978865339648688391","display_date":"October 16, 2025 · 16:47 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
