{"id":"twitter:1978797051744850100","tweet_id":"1978797051744850100","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1978797051744850100","title":"@RandPaul It's also disingenuous to call it spying The only reason the @FBI needed the call logs, which requires a supbeona Was because @POTUS used a ","summary":"@RandPaul It's also disingenuous to call it spying The only reason the @FBI needed the call logs, which requires a supbeona Was because @POTUS used a burner phone and not a managed device during the J6th putsch. That was the OG problem.","date":"2025-10-16","published":"2025-10-16T12:15:56+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/RandPaul/status/1978787070211391562","reply_tweet_id":"1978787070211391562","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@RandPaul It&#x27;s also disingenuous to call it spying<br><br>The only reason the @FBI needed the call logs, which requires a supbeona<br><br>Was because @POTUS used a burner phone and not a managed device during the J6th putsch.<br><br>That was the OG problem.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1978797051744850100","display_date":"October 16, 2025 · 12:15 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
