{"id":"twitter:1978523796228223059","tweet_id":"1978523796228223059","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1978523796228223059","title":"We took 20,000+ tweets mentioning \"ukronazi\" and then build a data model to correlate with ad buy campaigns on Twitter What do you know....you can eas","summary":"We took 20,000+ tweets mentioning \"ukronazi\" and then build a data model to correlate with ad buy campaigns on Twitter What do you know....you can easily predict and find bots on @x The correlation with bots and adbuys was quite significant https://t.co/w3CVWWsslh","date":"2025-10-15","published":"2025-10-15T18:10:06+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>We took 20,000+ tweets mentioning &quot;ukronazi&quot; and then build a data model to correlate with ad buy campaigns on Twitter<br><br>What do you know....you can easily predict and find bots on @x <br><br>The correlation with bots and adbuys was quite significant <a href=\"https://t.co/w3CVWWsslh\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/w3CVWWsslh</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/09ecccd8a700e943471ea9747bcc401d.png\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/1f58e320ad5580147f857835b28fb7f5.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1978523796228223059","display_date":"October 15, 2025 · 18:10 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/09ecccd8a700e943471ea9747bcc401d.png","/archive/twitter/media/1f58e320ad5580147f857835b28fb7f5.jpg"]}
