{"id":"twitter:1978517546463605076","tweet_id":"1978517546463605076","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1978517546463605076","title":"FYI Telegram group chats are not end-to-end encrypted by default. There is no option to enable this for group chats. They are protected by client-serv","summary":"FYI Telegram group chats are not end-to-end encrypted by default. There is no option to enable this for group chats. They are protected by client-server encryption That does nothing to stop social engineering, like blackmail https://x.com/jgmac1106/status/1978497712858263925","date":"2025-10-15","published":"2025-10-15T17:45:16+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>FYI Telegram group  chats are not end-to-end encrypted by default.<br><br>There is no option  to enable this for group chats. <br><br>They are protected by client-server  encryption<br><br>That does nothing to stop social engineering, like blackmail <a href=\"https://x.com/jgmac1106/status/1978497712858263925\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/jgmac1106/status/1978497712858263925</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1978517546463605076","display_date":"October 15, 2025 · 17:45 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1978517292272001254","tweet_id":"1978517292272001254","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1978517292272001254","title":"@Ilovecandies92 ahh my mistake. Yesou are correct. I mixed up Signal, Only \"secret\" chats are encrypted Group chats are not end-to-end encrypted by de","summary":"@Ilovecandies92 ahh my mistake. Yesou are correct. I mixed up Signal, Only \"secret\" chats are encrypted Group chats are not end-to-end encrypted by default, and there is no option to enable this for group chats. They are protected by client-server encryption","date":"2025-10-15","published":"2025-10-15T17:44:16+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/Ilovecandies92/status/1978516857930834239","reply_tweet_id":"1978516857930834239","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Ilovecandies92 ahh my mistake. Yesou are correct. I mixed up Signal,<br><br>Only &quot;secret&quot; chats are encrypted<br><br>Group  chats are not end-to-end encrypted by default, and there is no option  to enable this for group chats. They are protected by client-server  encryption</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1978517292272001254","display_date":"October 15, 2025 · 17:44 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1978515938291953811","tweet_id":"1978515938291953811","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1978515938291953811","title":"@Ilovecandies92 Yes, but not at the device level. So if you pwn the device you have access to the group chat If you Blackmail a group member, encrypti","summary":"@Ilovecandies92 Yes, but not at the device level. So if you pwn the device you have access to the group chat If you Blackmail a group member, encryption is meaningless","date":"2025-10-15","published":"2025-10-15T17:38:53+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/Ilovecandies92/status/1978511064829428198","reply_tweet_id":"1978511064829428198","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Ilovecandies92 Yes, but not at the device level. So if you pwn the device you have access to the group chat<br><br>If you Blackmail a group member, encryption is meaningless</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1978515938291953811","display_date":"October 15, 2025 · 17:38 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1978515648901767430","tweet_id":"1978515648901767430","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1978515648901767430","title":"@Smiley0515 We have procedures in place, and have prepared DACA students Faculty are instructed to lock classroom doors and not open them for anyone w","summary":"@Smiley0515 We have procedures in place, and have prepared DACA students Faculty are instructed to lock classroom doors and not open them for anyone without Police escort We don't know if ICE are targeting faculty or students or even if it is just RUMINT at this point.","date":"2025-10-15","published":"2025-10-15T17:37:44+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/Smiley0515/status/1978514849081565464","reply_tweet_id":"1978514849081565464","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Smiley0515 We have procedures in place, and have prepared DACA students<br><br>Faculty are instructed to lock classroom doors and not open them for anyone without Police escort<br><br>We don&#x27;t know if ICE  are targeting faculty or students or even if it is just RUMINT at this point.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1978515648901767430","display_date":"October 15, 2025 · 17:37 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
