{"id":"twitter:1977785624129134791","tweet_id":"1977785624129134791","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1977785624129134791","title":"Music is an ocean Vast emptiness carrying crescendos to shore as life drips in sounds of destiny I taste each note the bitter salt cutting the soul an","summary":"Music is an ocean Vast emptiness carrying crescendos to shore as life drips in sounds of destiny I taste each note the bitter salt cutting the soul and sand keeps time slipping through the toes #smallpoems https://t.co/QWaxvG6qhi","date":"2025-10-13","published":"2025-10-13T17:16:52+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":["smallpoems"],"body_html":"<p>Music is an ocean<br>Vast emptiness carrying<br>crescendos to shore<br>as life drips in sounds<br>of destiny I taste each note<br>the bitter salt cutting the soul<br>and sand keeps time slipping through the toes<br>#smallpoems <a href=\"https://t.co/QWaxvG6qhi\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/QWaxvG6qhi</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/13801f096db2bd82d1b6f458e7b1f875.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1977785624129134791","display_date":"October 13, 2025 · 17:16 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/13801f096db2bd82d1b6f458e7b1f875.jpg"]}
