{"id":"twitter:1977756000166748396","tweet_id":"1977756000166748396","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1977756000166748396","title":"@DecryptedTech @dasgrog I was just talking Edge market share and thinking this was due to M365 bundling. Most markets I work in usually have a Busines","summary":"@DecryptedTech @dasgrog I was just talking Edge market share and thinking this was due to M365 bundling. Most markets I work in usually have a Business Premium to G5 license So Intune and Defender gets bundled, but it's the use of Sentinel and Purview where companies often use a third party","date":"2025-10-13","published":"2025-10-13T15:19:10+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/DecryptedTech/status/1977753417142436017","reply_tweet_id":"1977753417142436017","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@DecryptedTech @dasgrog I was just talking Edge market share and thinking this was due to M365 bundling.<br><br>Most markets I work in usually have a Business Premium to G5 license<br><br>So Intune and Defender gets bundled, but it&#x27;s the use of Sentinel and Purview where companies often use a third party</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1977756000166748396","display_date":"October 13, 2025 · 15:19 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
