{"id":"twitter:1977482461308125477","tweet_id":"1977482461308125477","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1977482461308125477","title":"@infosec_fox Traditional computing which works on an electric level has to solve everything using just 1 and 0s. Quantum computing, which happens at a","summary":"@infosec_fox Traditional computing which works on an electric level has to solve everything using just 1 and 0s. Quantum computing, which happens at atomic levels uses numbers in between as well. Makes 3D lattice thats faster than strings of 1s and 0s Consider multiple sides of a problem","date":"2025-10-12","published":"2025-10-12T21:12:13+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/infosec_fox/status/1977478624610558133","reply_tweet_id":"1977478624610558133","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@infosec_fox Traditional computing which works on an electric level has to solve everything using just 1 and 0s.<br><br>Quantum computing, which happens at atomic levels uses numbers in between as well.<br><br>Makes 3D lattice thats faster than strings of 1s and 0s<br><br>Consider multiple sides of a problem</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1977482461308125477","display_date":"October 12, 2025 · 21:12 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
