{"id":"twitter:1977434084210081843","tweet_id":"1977434084210081843","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1977434084210081843","title":"Again it's not hard to understand. A supbeona is not spying. No phones were tapped. That takes a warrant. Call logs had to be used to figure out who @","summary":"Again it's not hard to understand. A supbeona is not spying. No phones were tapped. That takes a warrant. Call logs had to be used to figure out who @POTUS called because @POTUS used a burner phone and not a managed device. https://x.com/SenRonJohnson/status/1977355611172999278","date":"2025-10-12","published":"2025-10-12T17:59:59+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Again it&#x27;s not hard to understand.<br><br>A supbeona is not spying. No phones were tapped.<br><br>That takes a warrant.<br><br>Call logs had to be used to figure out who @POTUS called because @POTUS used a burner phone and not a managed device. <a href=\"https://x.com/SenRonJohnson/status/1977355611172999278\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/SenRonJohnson/status/1977355611172999278</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1977434084210081843","display_date":"October 12, 2025 · 17:59 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
