{"id":"twitter:1977431140148580426","tweet_id":"1977431140148580426","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1977431140148580426","title":"Because a bunch of people ransacked the Capitol and their may have been a conspiracy in planning the J6th putsch. But @POTUS was using a burner phone ","summary":"Because a bunch of people ransacked the Capitol and their may have been a conspiracy in planning the J6th putsch. But @POTUS was using a burner phone so @TheJusticeDept and the @FBI had to supbeona phone logs to figure out who @POTUS called. It isn't hard to understand. https://x.com/MarshaBlackburn/status/1977371655753121894 https://t.co/2zHWH9wWm6","date":"2025-10-12","published":"2025-10-12T17:48:17+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Because a bunch of people ransacked the Capitol and their may have been a conspiracy in planning the J6th putsch.<br><br>But @POTUS was using a burner phone so @TheJusticeDept and the @FBI had to supbeona phone logs to figure out who @POTUS called.<br><br>It isn&#x27;t hard to understand. <a href=\"https://x.com/MarshaBlackburn/status/1977371655753121894\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/MarshaBlackburn/status/1977371655753121894</a> <a href=\"https://t.co/2zHWH9wWm6\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/2zHWH9wWm6</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/2e0ffda3d6a51fa3405c90249b0f81bb.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1977431140148580426","display_date":"October 12, 2025 · 17:48 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/2e0ffda3d6a51fa3405c90249b0f81bb.jpg"]}
