{"id":"twitter:1976104752321810580","tweet_id":"1976104752321810580","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1976104752321810580","title":"@fella6h9 I use a training collar for my dog. You must train bird dogs if you hunt fowl so you know. The beep is more a reward like a clicker. We got ","summary":"@fella6h9 I use a training collar for my dog. You must train bird dogs if you hunt fowl so you know. The beep is more a reward like a clicker. We got Bobcats, Coywolfs etc. Plus don't want to piss off neighbors. The invisible fence didn't work. Easier to train my dogs.","date":"2025-10-09","published":"2025-10-09T01:57:41+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/FellaHrx69/status/1976102056852324387","reply_tweet_id":"1976102056852324387","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@fella6h9 I use a training collar for my dog.<br><br>You must train bird dogs if you hunt fowl so you know.<br><br>The beep is more a reward like a clicker.<br><br>We got Bobcats, Coywolfs etc. Plus don&#x27;t want to piss off neighbors.<br><br>The invisible fence didn&#x27;t work. Easier to train my dogs.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1976104752321810580","display_date":"October 09, 2025 · 01:57 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
