{"id":"twitter:1975950025521070122","tweet_id":"1975950025521070122","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1975950025521070122","title":"@aspiringpeasant Hey @grok write me a short story about the battle between the Beardos and the Furries for the control of American cities In the first","summary":"@aspiringpeasant Hey @grok write me a short story about the battle between the Beardos and the Furries for the control of American cities In the first picture you have the Beardos deployed by the Statists. In the second picture you have the Furry Freedom fighters of Antifa https://t.co/ZakgW0iFNb","date":"2025-10-08","published":"2025-10-08T15:42:52+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/aspiringpeasant/status/1975939326719803601","reply_tweet_id":"1975939326719803601","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@aspiringpeasant Hey @grok write me a short story about the battle between the Beardos and the Furries for the control of American cities<br><br>In the first picture you have the Beardos deployed by the  Statists. In the second picture you have the Furry Freedom fighters of Antifa <a href=\"https://t.co/ZakgW0iFNb\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/ZakgW0iFNb</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/ae42037341945f7624e02f849fcaac4b.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/50907bff8fade626d1af9694838c8b69.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1975950025521070122","display_date":"October 08, 2025 · 15:42 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/ae42037341945f7624e02f849fcaac4b.jpg","/archive/twitter/media/50907bff8fade626d1af9694838c8b69.jpg"]}
{"id":"twitter:1975948839824867669","tweet_id":"1975948839824867669","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1975948839824867669","title":"Then you need to make sure your recovery procedures actually work This is why I am thinking we should connect Cybersecurity Awareness Month with Backt","summary":"Then you need to make sure your recovery procedures actually work This is why I am thinking we should connect Cybersecurity Awareness Month with Backtober Pick then to, at a minimum, test your recovery procedures Test, Train, Excercise Patch your People. Help Stop APTs https://t.co/CYhHLAmhZo","date":"2025-10-08","published":"2025-10-08T15:38:09+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1975948298583506957","reply_tweet_id":"1975948298583506957","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Then you need to make sure your recovery procedures actually work<br><br>This is why I am thinking we should connect Cybersecurity Awareness Month with Backtober<br><br>Pick then to, at a minimum, test your recovery procedures <br><br>Test, Train, Excercise<br><br>Patch your People. Help Stop APTs <a href=\"https://t.co/CYhHLAmhZo\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/CYhHLAmhZo</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/241769ac000b7118ada2809fa47e995a.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1975948839824867669","display_date":"October 08, 2025 · 15:38 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/241769ac000b7118ada2809fa47e995a.jpg"]}
{"id":"twitter:1975948298583506957","tweet_id":"1975948298583506957","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1975948298583506957","title":"And you need to think about the destruction of your backups Back ups lying around are like enema bottles for attackers. They can let them spray your s","summary":"And you need to think about the destruction of your backups Back ups lying around are like enema bottles for attackers. They can let them spray your shit everywhere You have a media destruction policy, this includes backups (again this is written for 171..old 88) https://t.co/HQkBTHZTqI","date":"2025-10-08","published":"2025-10-08T15:36:00+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1975947831455412716","reply_tweet_id":"1975947831455412716","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>And you need to think about the destruction of your backups<br><br>Back ups lying around are like enema bottles for attackers. They can let them spray your shit everywhere<br><br>You have a media destruction policy, this includes backups<br><br>(again this is written for 171..old 88) <a href=\"https://t.co/HQkBTHZTqI\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/HQkBTHZTqI</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/e4421df0968acd3874573edba16c59ef.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1975948298583506957","display_date":"October 08, 2025 · 15:36 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/e4421df0968acd3874573edba16c59ef.jpg"]}
{"id":"twitter:1975947831455412716","tweet_id":"1975947831455412716","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1975947831455412716","title":"Cool, so now you have back ups? Now what? you have new shit you must protect if you want to protect all your important shit Don't care what regulation","summary":"Cool, so now you have back ups? Now what? you have new shit you must protect if you want to protect all your important shit Don't care what regulations you must meet (these are for CMMC/171) but multiple controls are required for protecting backups Like Patching your People https://t.co/xW0BFu4prJ","date":"2025-10-08","published":"2025-10-08T15:34:09+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1975947115701674209","reply_tweet_id":"1975947115701674209","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Cool, so now you have back ups?<br><br>Now what?<br><br>you have new shit you must protect if you want to protect all your important shit<br><br>Don&#x27;t care what regulations you must meet (these are for CMMC/171) but multiple controls are required for protecting backups<br><br>Like Patching your People <a href=\"https://t.co/xW0BFu4prJ\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/xW0BFu4prJ</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/6b7062aa2219dc935347f10b190c215b.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1975947831455412716","display_date":"October 08, 2025 · 15:34 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/6b7062aa2219dc935347f10b190c215b.jpg"]}
{"id":"twitter:1975947115701674209","tweet_id":"1975947115701674209","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1975947115701674209","title":"Cloud vendors do not come without risk You are trusting someone else to watch your shit and make sure they can shove the shit back in your system afte","summary":"Cloud vendors do not come without risk You are trusting someone else to watch your shit and make sure they can shove the shit back in your system after an incident. Why I favor encryption, then cloud back ups if your system constraints allow it. https://t.co/kErPGE13XK","date":"2025-10-08","published":"2025-10-08T15:31:18+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1975946719515853106","reply_tweet_id":"1975946719515853106","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Cloud vendors do not come without risk<br><br>You are trusting someone else to watch your shit and make sure they can shove the shit back in your system after an incident.<br><br>Why I favor encryption, then cloud back ups if your system constraints allow it. <a href=\"https://t.co/kErPGE13XK\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/kErPGE13XK</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/7f3f40a7684d7ce63340144fa399c990.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1975947115701674209","display_date":"October 08, 2025 · 15:31 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/7f3f40a7684d7ce63340144fa399c990.jpg"]}
{"id":"twitter:1975946719515853106","tweet_id":"1975946719515853106","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1975946719515853106","title":"Y'all are all going to choose an MSP backup solution. You have no internal IT team besides Bob in Accounting But you need to know what kind of media t","summary":"Y'all are all going to choose an MSP backup solution. You have no internal IT team besides Bob in Accounting But you need to know what kind of media they will store your backups on (and if you encrypt before backup you can descope a lot of things) https://t.co/Q2SwaPZbJw","date":"2025-10-08","published":"2025-10-08T15:29:43+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1975945905921572912","reply_tweet_id":"1975945905921572912","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Y&#x27;all are all going to choose an MSP backup solution. You have no internal IT team besides Bob in Accounting<br><br>But you need to know what kind of media they will store your backups on<br><br>(and if you encrypt before backup you can descope a lot of things) <a href=\"https://t.co/Q2SwaPZbJw\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/Q2SwaPZbJw</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/b103c62b97ebfefd217b51cb2dcc2d49.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1975946719515853106","display_date":"October 08, 2025 · 15:29 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/b103c62b97ebfefd217b51cb2dcc2d49.jpg"]}
{"id":"twitter:1975946286659772624","tweet_id":"1975946286659772624","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1975946286659772624","title":"Stopping ransomware is really as easy as 3-2-1 Promise Almost all ransomware can be stopped with a 3-2-1 back up approach Three Copies Two Types of Me","summary":"Stopping ransomware is really as easy as 3-2-1 Promise Almost all ransomware can be stopped with a 3-2-1 back up approach Three Copies Two Types of Media One off site https://t.co/nRmVZjxDtX","date":"2025-10-08","published":"2025-10-08T15:28:00+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1975945905921572912","reply_tweet_id":"1975945905921572912","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Stopping ransomware is really as easy as 3-2-1<br><br>Promise<br><br>Almost all ransomware can be stopped with a 3-2-1 back up approach<br><br>Three Copies<br>Two Types of Media<br>One off site <a href=\"https://t.co/nRmVZjxDtX\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/nRmVZjxDtX</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/b341e898ea5c63ad51cc4dd2ce616a41.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1975946286659772624","display_date":"October 08, 2025 · 15:28 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/b341e898ea5c63ad51cc4dd2ce616a41.jpg"]}
{"id":"twitter:1975945905921572912","tweet_id":"1975945905921572912","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1975945905921572912","title":"(grrr typo *184 not 174) sit down and make a Backup Plan. isn't just call a vendor and set it and forget it (because then you will forget where you se","summary":"(grrr typo *184 not 174) sit down and make a Backup Plan. isn't just call a vendor and set it and forget it (because then you will forget where you set your keys) Identity shit to protect, determine how important that shit is, and write down how leaking shit is gross https://t.co/56TTA4XVYF","date":"2025-10-08","published":"2025-10-08T15:26:29+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1975945114016211329","reply_tweet_id":"1975945114016211329","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>(grrr typo *184 not 174)<br><br> sit down and make a Backup Plan.  isn&#x27;t just call a vendor and set it  and forget it <br><br>(because then you will forget where you set your keys)<br><br>Identity shit  to protect, determine how important that shit is, and write down how<br><br>leaking shit is gross <a href=\"https://t.co/56TTA4XVYF\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/56TTA4XVYF</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/21e6086369122599d1cd62a5361c33b1.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1975945905921572912","display_date":"October 08, 2025 · 15:26 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/21e6086369122599d1cd62a5361c33b1.jpg"]}
{"id":"twitter:1975945114016211329","tweet_id":"1975945114016211329","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1975945114016211329","title":"To me it boils down to Eight essential steps (that I stole from NIST-SP-800-174) Literally everyone can do this And you help thwart attacks from quasi","summary":"To me it boils down to Eight essential steps (that I stole from NIST-SP-800-174) Literally everyone can do this And you help thwart attacks from quasi-state based hacker gangs attacking schools and hospitals You can't stop Advanced Persistent Threats, but you can tax them https://t.co/buZ27V8Ylg","date":"2025-10-08","published":"2025-10-08T15:23:21+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1975944554504417354","reply_tweet_id":"1975944554504417354","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>To me it boils down to Eight essential steps (that I stole from NIST-SP-800-174)<br><br>Literally everyone can do this<br><br>And you help thwart attacks from quasi-state based hacker gangs attacking schools and hospitals<br><br>You can&#x27;t stop Advanced Persistent Threats, but you can tax them <a href=\"https://t.co/buZ27V8Ylg\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/buZ27V8Ylg</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/f6fb1c730c6d5b3accae120cfbe12e2f.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1975945114016211329","display_date":"October 08, 2025 · 15:23 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/f6fb1c730c6d5b3accae120cfbe12e2f.jpg"]}
{"id":"twitter:1975944554504417354","tweet_id":"1975944554504417354","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1975944554504417354","title":"It is Cybersecurity Awareness Month, and one thing I think about: Good Backups are the new Victory Garden Reading @IceSolst this morning and working w","summary":"It is Cybersecurity Awareness Month, and one thing I think about: Good Backups are the new Victory Garden Reading @IceSolst this morning and working with Construction and Manufacturing company, made me realize Just make it Backtober. Ransomware can be stopped https://t.co/ZKkpN0SioU","date":"2025-10-08","published":"2025-10-08T15:21:07+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>It is Cybersecurity Awareness Month, and one thing I think about:<br><br>Good Backups are the new Victory Garden<br><br>Reading @IceSolst this morning and working with Construction and Manufacturing company, made me realize <br><br>Just make it Backtober. Ransomware can be stopped <a href=\"https://t.co/ZKkpN0SioU\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/ZKkpN0SioU</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/3c14f057cc5b7eabb59c169b94321240.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1975944554504417354","display_date":"October 08, 2025 · 15:21 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/3c14f057cc5b7eabb59c169b94321240.jpg"]}
{"id":"twitter:1975943154223436141","tweet_id":"1975943154223436141","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1975943154223436141","title":"@SquirrelPocket @IceSolst But I keep thinking about modern deployment. A static file is easier to deploy and secure. Accessible in lofi/nofi condition","summary":"@SquirrelPocket @IceSolst But I keep thinking about modern deployment. A static file is easier to deploy and secure. Accessible in lofi/nofi conditions. Read/Write RBAac easier If you can train a RAG, and just ingest an API. Do so many apps that could be a Google Form need a database anymore?","date":"2025-10-08","published":"2025-10-08T15:15:33+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1975935247658459200","reply_tweet_id":"1975935247658459200","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@SquirrelPocket @IceSolst But I keep thinking about modern deployment.<br><br>A static file is easier to deploy and secure. Accessible in lofi/nofi conditions.<br><br>Read/Write RBAac easier<br><br>If you can train a RAG, and just ingest an API.<br><br>Do so many apps that could be a Google Form need a database anymore?</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1975943154223436141","display_date":"October 08, 2025 · 15:15 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
