{"id":"twitter:1975200347552694534","tweet_id":"1975200347552694534","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1975200347552694534","title":"Fun fact: There is no law in the US Government to declare a domestic group a terrorist organization. Individuals like Mr Sorter and Fat Tommy can be c","summary":"Fun fact: There is no law in the US Government to declare a domestic group a terrorist organization. Individuals like Mr Sorter and Fat Tommy can be charged with crimes, but you literally can't name Antifa a terrorist group. The @@GOP is lying to you. https://x.com/StephenM/status/1975176891805163824","date":"2025-10-06","published":"2025-10-06T14:03:54+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Fun fact: There is no law in the US Government to declare a domestic group a terrorist organization.<br><br>Individuals like Mr Sorter and Fat Tommy can be charged with crimes, but you literally can&#x27;t name Antifa a terrorist group.<br><br>The @@GOP is lying to you. <a href=\"https://x.com/StephenM/status/1975176891805163824\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/StephenM/status/1975176891805163824</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1975200347552694534","display_date":"October 06, 2025 · 14:03 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
