{"id":"twitter:2068698929135292647","tweet_id":"2068698929135292647","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=2068698929135292647","title":"The B has been silent since the 13th century. It's a proto-Germania root from dumbaz which traces back to the PIE word dheubh and the root dheu Modern","summary":"The B has been silent since the 13th century. It's a proto-Germania root from dumbaz which traces back to the PIE word dheubh and the root dheu Modern use does come from the German, or at least Pennsylvania German word dumm https://x.com/mikenelson586/status/2068355540758004111","date":"2026-06-21","published":"2026-06-21T14:13:53+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>The B has been silent since the 13th century.<br><br>It&#x27;s a proto-Germania root from dumbaz which traces back to the PIE word dheubh and the root dheu<br><br>Modern use does come from the German, or at least Pennsylvania German word dumm <a href=\"https://x.com/mikenelson586/status/2068355540758004111\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/mikenelson586/status/2068355540758004111</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2068698929135292647","display_date":"June 21, 2026 · 14:13 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
