{"id":"twitter:1975170033257988203","tweet_id":"1975170033257988203","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1975170033257988203","title":"There is a major legal difference between a Guard serving under a Governor and one serving as Federalized. One is held to State law and the other to t","summary":"There is a major legal difference between a Guard serving under a Governor and one serving as Federalized. One is held to State law and the other to the Uniform Code of Justice. The 2nd Amendment was written to prevent the scenario @StephenM wants https://x.com/StephenM/status/1975057126675578881","date":"2025-10-06","published":"2025-10-06T12:03:27+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>There is a major legal difference between a Guard serving under a Governor and one serving as Federalized.<br><br>One is held to State law and the other to the Uniform Code of Justice.<br><br>The 2nd Amendment was written to prevent the scenario @StephenM wants <a href=\"https://x.com/StephenM/status/1975057126675578881\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/StephenM/status/1975057126675578881</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1975170033257988203","display_date":"October 06, 2025 · 12:03 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
