{"id":"twitter:1973156578829484440","tweet_id":"1973156578829484440","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1973156578829484440","title":"The Territorial Defense Force is the youngest branch of the Armed Forces of Ukraine. Organized with a brigade in each region and a battalion in each d","summary":"The Territorial Defense Force is the youngest branch of the Armed Forces of Ukraine. Organized with a brigade in each region and a battalion in each district. While TDF was envisioned for local Defense units all fought and fight on the front Evolved greatly since 2022 https://t.co/FSF0zJHAbt","date":"2025-09-30","published":"2025-09-30T22:42:42+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>The Territorial Defense Force is the youngest  branch of the Armed Forces of Ukraine.<br><br>Organized with a brigade in  each region and a battalion in each district. <br><br>While TDF was envisioned for local Defense units all fought and fight on the  front<br><br>Evolved greatly since 2022 <a href=\"https://t.co/FSF0zJHAbt\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/FSF0zJHAbt</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/4292ab5424891c42d5b2d8c8342189f2.png\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1973156578829484440","display_date":"September 30, 2025 · 22:42 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/4292ab5424891c42d5b2d8c8342189f2.png"]}
