{"id":"twitter:1971349883786600694","tweet_id":"1971349883786600694","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1971349883786600694","title":"I mean if russia spends 1/3 a billion dollars to sway elections why wouldn't the Government ask? (Be nice if either the US or UK Government asked abou","summary":"I mean if russia spends 1/3 a billion dollars to sway elections why wouldn't the Government ask? (Be nice if either the US or UK Government asked about Cambridge Analytica/Steve Bannon and Possible Sukov/Malofeev ties) https://t.co/dFF7kBoQe4","date":"2025-09-25","published":"2025-09-25T23:03:32+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1971345941883126037","reply_tweet_id":"1971345941883126037","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>I mean if russia spends 1/3 a billion dollars to sway elections why wouldn&#x27;t the Government ask?<br><br>(Be nice if either the US or UK Government asked about Cambridge Analytica/Steve Bannon and Possible Sukov/Malofeev ties) <a href=\"https://t.co/dFF7kBoQe4\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/dFF7kBoQe4</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/a1afafd93cd91f4bd068a9d3ceb6d969.png\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1971349883786600694","display_date":"September 25, 2025 · 23:03 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/a1afafd93cd91f4bd068a9d3ceb6d969.png"]}
{"id":"twitter:1971349014529654972","tweet_id":"1971349014529654972","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1971349014529654972","title":"@erickmeza10 @DefiantLs This book, though it has a center-left bias, is a good theoretical overview of network \"tightness,\" or homophily The GOP is a ","summary":"@erickmeza10 @DefiantLs This book, though it has a center-left bias, is a good theoretical overview of network \"tightness,\" or homophily The GOP is a party of ideological purity and the DNC a coalition of special interests So networks IRL look like a bright start on right and constellations on left https://t.co/y3SoXr1ubC","date":"2025-09-25","published":"2025-09-25T23:00:05+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1971347624566587823","reply_tweet_id":"1971347624566587823","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@erickmeza10 @DefiantLs This book, though it has a center-left bias, is a good theoretical overview of network &quot;tightness,&quot; or homophily<br><br>The GOP is a party of ideological purity and the DNC a coalition of special interests<br><br>So networks IRL look like a bright start on right and constellations on left <a href=\"https://t.co/y3SoXr1ubC\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/y3SoXr1ubC</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/acb0975fcdef968215f00d09de6ef829.png\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1971349014529654972","display_date":"September 25, 2025 · 23:00 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/acb0975fcdef968215f00d09de6ef829.png"]}
{"id":"twitter:1971347624566587823","tweet_id":"1971347624566587823","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1971347624566587823","title":"@erickmeza10 @DefiantLs There data maybe open. I didn't look close. I am just not a fan of 100 point Likert scales for Semantic Differential variables","summary":"@erickmeza10 @DefiantLs There data maybe open. I didn't look close. I am just not a fan of 100 point Likert scales for Semantic Differential variables People gravitate to extremes when you provide too many options. Skews correlations But not everyone agrees. (also the OGP doesn't post in good faith)","date":"2025-09-25","published":"2025-09-25T22:54:34+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/erickmeza10/status/1971345239710507471","reply_tweet_id":"1971345239710507471","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@erickmeza10 @DefiantLs There data maybe open. I didn&#x27;t look close. I am just not a fan of 100 point Likert scales for Semantic Differential variables<br><br>People gravitate to extremes when you provide too many options. Skews correlations<br><br>But not everyone agrees.<br><br>(also the OGP doesn&#x27;t post in good faith)</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1971347624566587823","display_date":"September 25, 2025 · 22:54 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
