{"id":"twitter:1970559055031947641","tweet_id":"1970559055031947641","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1970559055031947641","title":"George Pendergast started editing Wikipedia in his 80s. He just turned 100 years old, and he continues to contribute to Wikipedia today. At 100, G3 is","summary":"George Pendergast started editing Wikipedia in his 80s. He just turned 100 years old, and he continues to contribute to Wikipedia today. At 100, G3 is still learning, refining grammar, and debating word choice. Be like George https://t.co/tlrXiNUTKl","date":"2025-09-23","published":"2025-09-23T18:41:04+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>George Pendergast  started editing Wikipedia in his 80s. He just turned 100 years old, and he continues to  contribute to Wikipedia today.<br><br>At 100, G3 is  still learning, refining grammar, and debating word choice. <br><br>Be like George <a href=\"https://t.co/tlrXiNUTKl\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/tlrXiNUTKl</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/f9b7fdafc7951cd398a9a717e8bfc90f.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1970559055031947641","display_date":"September 23, 2025 · 18:41 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/f9b7fdafc7951cd398a9a717e8bfc90f.jpg"]}
{"id":"twitter:1970557816206139497","tweet_id":"1970557816206139497","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1970557816206139497","title":"@AirwolfBonds ]Needing a self-assessment and then third-party assessment of NIST-SP-800-171 security requirements Think RMF, -53, and DIBCAC if you di","summary":"@AirwolfBonds ]Needing a self-assessment and then third-party assessment of NIST-SP-800-171 security requirements Think RMF, -53, and DIBCAC if you did supply chain or cyber stuff for the military. DFARS -53 are just federall owned systems, -171 are systems authorized to hold federal data","date":"2025-09-23","published":"2025-09-23T18:36:09+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/AirwolfBonds/status/1970556515699302622","reply_tweet_id":"1970556515699302622","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@AirwolfBonds ]Needing a self-assessment and then third-party assessment of NIST-SP-800-171 security requirements<br><br>Think RMF, -53, and DIBCAC if you did  supply chain or cyber stuff for the military. DFARS<br><br>-53 are just federall owned systems, -171 are systems authorized to hold federal data</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1970557816206139497","display_date":"September 23, 2025 · 18:36 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
