{"id":"twitter:1970293688371744930","tweet_id":"1970293688371744930","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1970293688371744930","title":"@SG3neris Pointing out there is no legal way to declare a non-existent or existing domestic group a terrorist organization under US Law isn't exactly ","summary":"@SG3neris Pointing out there is no legal way to declare a non-existent or existing domestic group a terrorist organization under US Law isn't exactly a call to arms. I am referring to INA and Title 18 Mainly. A little bit of EO 13224. What is the proper response to the White House?","date":"2025-09-23","published":"2025-09-23T01:06:36+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/SG3neris/status/1970292905563824155","reply_tweet_id":"1970292905563824155","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@SG3neris Pointing out there is no legal way to declare a non-existent or existing domestic group a terrorist organization under US Law isn&#x27;t exactly a call to arms.<br><br>I am referring to INA and Title 18 Mainly. A little bit of EO 13224.<br><br>What is the proper response to the White House?</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1970293688371744930","display_date":"September 23, 2025 · 01:06 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
