{"id":"twitter:1969838725828866394","tweet_id":"1969838725828866394","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1969838725828866394","title":"German intellectuals started to warn that traditional German culture was being erased Word was born Kulturbolschewismus, or Culture Bolshevism. Call i","summary":"German intellectuals started to warn that traditional German culture was being erased Word was born Kulturbolschewismus, or Culture Bolshevism. Call it cultural marxism today. In Germany anti-communism became a part of Nazi churches, Protestant and Catholic Who blamed Jews","date":"2025-09-21","published":"2025-09-21T18:58:44+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1969837271215174051","reply_tweet_id":"1969837271215174051","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>German intellectuals started to warn that traditional German culture was being erased<br><br>Word was born<br><br>Kulturbolschewismus, or Culture Bolshevism.<br><br>Call it cultural marxism today.<br><br>In Germany anti-communism became a part of Nazi churches, Protestant and Catholic<br><br>Who blamed Jews</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1969838725828866394","display_date":"September 21, 2025 · 18:58 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1969837271215174051","tweet_id":"1969837271215174051","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1969837271215174051","title":"Then Hitler came to power in 1933 without winning a majority of votes and was appointed Chancellor by the autocrats who feared commies more than Nazis","summary":"Then Hitler came to power in 1933 without winning a majority of votes and was appointed Chancellor by the autocrats who feared commies more than Nazis. Beginning in 1933 Eberhard Taubert began to study the Jewish Question in Goebbels anti-Komintern's department.","date":"2025-09-21","published":"2025-09-21T18:52:57+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1969835000859422887","reply_tweet_id":"1969835000859422887","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Then Hitler came to power in 1933 without winning a majority of votes and was appointed Chancellor by the autocrats who feared commies more than Nazis.<br><br>Beginning in 1933  Eberhard Taubert began to study the Jewish Question in Goebbels anti-Komintern&#x27;s department.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1969837271215174051","display_date":"September 21, 2025 · 18:52 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
