{"id":"twitter:1969835000859422887","tweet_id":"1969835000859422887","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1969835000859422887","title":"The beer halls of Munich in 1920s railed with cries of Judeo-Bolshevism. In the 1930s the Nazi SA would fight the German Red Gaurd. Then the Nazis thr","summary":"The beer halls of Munich in 1920s railed with cries of Judeo-Bolshevism. In the 1930s the Nazi SA would fight the German Red Gaurd. Then the Nazis threw a big Fash Funeral for Horst Wessel who was shot by a communist. Goebbels, of course, blamed the Jew. https://t.co/R19UyAc4bE","date":"2025-09-21","published":"2025-09-21T18:43:56+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1969833750209933357","reply_tweet_id":"1969833750209933357","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>The beer halls of Munich in 1920s railed with cries of Judeo-Bolshevism.<br><br>In the 1930s the Nazi SA would fight the German Red Gaurd.<br><br>Then the Nazis threw a big Fash Funeral for Horst Wessel who was shot by a communist.<br><br>Goebbels, of course, blamed the Jew. <a href=\"https://t.co/R19UyAc4bE\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/R19UyAc4bE</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/1e19ac8808bbe69293d567dad39fcde9.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1969835000859422887","display_date":"September 21, 2025 · 18:43 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/1e19ac8808bbe69293d567dad39fcde9.jpg"]}
{"id":"twitter:1969833750209933357","tweet_id":"1969833750209933357","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1969833750209933357","title":"Nazism was born in Bavaria after the short-lived Bavarian Republic of Councils which ruled most of Munich from November of 1918 to May of 1919. The \"N","summary":"Nazism was born in Bavaria after the short-lived Bavarian Republic of Councils which ruled most of Munich from November of 1918 to May of 1919. The \"November Criminals\" of the German Revolution would be used as proof of a Jewish world Bolshevik plot. https://t.co/bB9T2SyIyC","date":"2025-09-21","published":"2025-09-21T18:38:58+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1969832302479036892","reply_tweet_id":"1969832302479036892","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Nazism was born in Bavaria after the  short-lived Bavarian Republic of Councils which ruled most of Munich from November of 1918 to May of 1919.<br><br>The &quot;November Criminals&quot; of the German Revolution would be used as proof of a Jewish world Bolshevik plot. <a href=\"https://t.co/bB9T2SyIyC\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/bB9T2SyIyC</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/6085e9b91a82f6345e7ef344db8567ff.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1969833750209933357","display_date":"September 21, 2025 · 18:38 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/6085e9b91a82f6345e7ef344db8567ff.jpg"]}
{"id":"twitter:1969832302479036892","tweet_id":"1969832302479036892","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1969832302479036892","title":"At first Hitler shared view of many russian Nationalists and Whites. Jewish Soviet Leaders were part of an Asiatic plot and different than the German ","summary":"At first Hitler shared view of many russian Nationalists and Whites. Jewish Soviet Leaders were part of an Asiatic plot and different than the German monarchy of russia. As russia and Eastern Europe became \"Living Space\" in Hitler's eyes, threat of Judeo-Bolshevism increased https://t.co/CbQLMG8Ke2","date":"2025-09-21","published":"2025-09-21T18:33:13+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1969830841879814600","reply_tweet_id":"1969830841879814600","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>At first Hitler shared  view of many russian Nationalists and Whites.<br><br>Jewish Soviet Leaders were part of an Asiatic plot and different than the German monarchy of russia.<br><br>As russia and Eastern Europe became &quot;Living Space&quot; in Hitler&#x27;s eyes, threat of Judeo-Bolshevism increased <a href=\"https://t.co/CbQLMG8Ke2\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/CbQLMG8Ke2</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/34554d0e1ddddf496fe6d5396de7f9ee.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1969832302479036892","display_date":"September 21, 2025 · 18:33 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/34554d0e1ddddf496fe6d5396de7f9ee.jpg"]}
{"id":"twitter:1969830841879814600","tweet_id":"1969830841879814600","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1969830841879814600","title":"Adolf Hitler was always antisemitic, but his focus on the threat of Judeo-Bolshevism did not show up in speeches until 1920. After the War, the refuge","summary":"Adolf Hitler was always antisemitic, but his focus on the threat of Judeo-Bolshevism did not show up in speeches until 1920. After the War, the refugee crisis of the Pogroms and coverage of the russian civil war. Hitler became fixated that Bolshevism was a Jewish Plot. https://t.co/ogsig23JwU","date":"2025-09-21","published":"2025-09-21T18:27:25+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1969828860759064852","reply_tweet_id":"1969828860759064852","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Adolf Hitler was always antisemitic, but his focus on the threat of Judeo-Bolshevism did not show up in speeches until 1920.<br><br>After the  War, the refugee crisis of the Pogroms and  coverage of the russian civil war.<br><br>Hitler became fixated that Bolshevism was a Jewish Plot. <a href=\"https://t.co/ogsig23JwU\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/ogsig23JwU</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/5abfd75e94ebe2f8af9e0c3679cc0136.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1969830841879814600","display_date":"September 21, 2025 · 18:27 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/5abfd75e94ebe2f8af9e0c3679cc0136.jpg"]}
