{"id":"twitter:1969520911779840129","tweet_id":"1969520911779840129","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1969520911779840129","title":"Dear folks, This is the answer to, \"Will you let boys in girls locker rooms\" \"Instead of focusing on an issue that impacts 0.0% of schools I'd rather ","summary":"Dear folks, This is the answer to, \"Will you let boys in girls locker rooms\" \"Instead of focusing on an issue that impacts 0.0% of schools I'd rather work with my colleagues to get Cheerleadung recognized as a sport under Title IX.\"","date":"2025-09-20","published":"2025-09-20T21:55:51+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Dear folks,<br><br>This is the answer to, &quot;Will you let boys in girls locker rooms&quot;<br><br>&quot;Instead of focusing on an issue that impacts 0.0% of schools I&#x27;d rather work with my colleagues to get Cheerleadung recognized as a sport under Title IX.&quot;</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1969520911779840129","display_date":"September 20, 2025 · 21:55 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1969520210504745191","tweet_id":"1969520210504745191","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1969520210504745191","title":"@maratdbv @FCC @Disney A Government can ask. Every agency has a PR Department. It is up to the social media to comply or not comply. When the Governme","summary":"@maratdbv @FCC @Disney A Government can ask. Every agency has a PR Department. It is up to the social media to comply or not comply. When the Government threatens licenses or does mergers as Quid Pro Quo's, that crosses the line into illegality.","date":"2025-09-20","published":"2025-09-20T21:53:04+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/maratdbv/status/1969489439308058923","reply_tweet_id":"1969489439308058923","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@maratdbv @FCC @Disney A Government can ask. Every agency has a PR Department.<br><br>It is up to the social media to comply or not comply.<br><br>When the Government threatens licenses or does mergers as Quid Pro Quo&#x27;s, that crosses the line into illegality.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1969520210504745191","display_date":"September 20, 2025 · 21:53 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
