{"id":"twitter:1968755792904966278","tweet_id":"1968755792904966278","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1968755792904966278","title":"You can be charged as an individual under Title 18 of the U.S. Code for committing attacks of terrorism, RICO or seditious conspiracies could be used ","summary":"You can be charged as an individual under Title 18 of the U.S. Code for committing attacks of terrorism, RICO or seditious conspiracies could be used to go after a domestic group But because of Free Speech and Assembly laws domestic groups don't get labeled terrorist","date":"2025-09-18","published":"2025-09-18T19:15:33+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1968751354144276682","reply_tweet_id":"1968751354144276682","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>You can be charged as an individual under Title 18 of the U.S. Code for committing  attacks of terrorism, RICO or seditious conspiracies could be used to go after a domestic group<br><br>But because of Free Speech and Assembly laws domestic groups don&#x27;t get labeled terrorist</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1968755792904966278","display_date":"September 18, 2025 · 19:15 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
