{"id":"twitter:1968751354144276682","tweet_id":"1968751354144276682","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1968751354144276682","title":"But under Executive Order 13224 almost 8,000 identities (people or orgs) are sanctioned as “specially designated global terrorists” https://www.treasu","summary":"But under Executive Order 13224 almost 8,000 identities (people or orgs) are sanctioned as “specially designated global terrorists” https://www.treasury.gov/ofac/downloads/sdnlist.pdf This is why you hear words like \"seek\" authority because there is no authority to label domestic groups","date":"2025-09-18","published":"2025-09-18T18:57:55+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1968750666060382590","reply_tweet_id":"1968750666060382590","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>But under Executive Order 13224 almost 8,000 identities (people or orgs) are sanctioned as “specially designated global terrorists” <a href=\"https://www.treasury.gov/ofac/downloads/sdnlist.pdf\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://www.treasury.gov/ofac/downloads/sdnlist.pdf</a><br><br>This is why you hear words like &quot;seek&quot; authority<br><br>because there is no authority to label domestic groups</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1968751354144276682","display_date":"September 18, 2025 · 18:57 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1968750666060382590","tweet_id":"1968750666060382590","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1968750666060382590","title":"In the US we have the FTO list: https://www.state.gov/foreign-terrorist-organizations and the Bureau of Counterterrorism in the State Department cpntr","summary":"In the US we have the FTO list: https://www.state.gov/foreign-terrorist-organizations and the Bureau of Counterterrorism in the State Department cpntrols that list undersection 219 of the Immigration and Nationality Act","date":"2025-09-18","published":"2025-09-18T18:55:11+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1968750126605676756","reply_tweet_id":"1968750126605676756","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>In the US we have the FTO list: <a href=\"https://www.state.gov/foreign-terrorist-organizations\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://www.state.gov/foreign-terrorist-organizations</a> and  the Bureau of Counterterrorism in the State Department cpntrols that list undersection 219 of the Immigration and Nationality Act</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1968750666060382590","display_date":"September 18, 2025 · 18:55 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1968750126605676756","tweet_id":"1968750126605676756","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1968750126605676756","title":"So far Trump said he will only \"seek\" designation. There is no legal mechanism in the United States for labeling domestic organizations as terrorist g","summary":"So far Trump said he will only \"seek\" designation. There is no legal mechanism in the United States for labeling domestic organizations as terrorist groups. You need to make a foreign actor connection https://abcnews.go.com/Politics/trump-hell-seek-designate-antifa-major-terrorist-organization/story?id=125693568","date":"2025-09-18","published":"2025-09-18T18:53:02+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1968749711721988401","reply_tweet_id":"1968749711721988401","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>So far Trump said he will only &quot;seek&quot; designation. <br><br>There is no legal mechanism in the United States for labeling  domestic organizations as terrorist groups.<br><br>You need to make a foreign actor connection<br><br><a href=\"https://abcnews.go.com/Politics/trump-hell-seek-designate-antifa-major-terrorist-organization/story?id=125693568\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://abcnews.go.com/Politics/trump-hell-seek-designate-antifa-major-terrorist-organization/story?id=125693568</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1968750126605676756","display_date":"September 18, 2025 · 18:53 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
