{"id":"twitter:1967210847266361542","tweet_id":"1967210847266361542","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1967210847266361542","title":"@NAFOApresSki It is a newer word and a combination of \"in\" plus pathos Syn means “along with, together” Sympathy is understanding someone's feelings a","summary":"@NAFOApresSki It is a newer word and a combination of \"in\" plus pathos Syn means “along with, together” Sympathy is understanding someone's feelings and empathy is feeling someone's feeling What Kirk was doing was throwing shade on the field of psychology as a challenge to God.","date":"2025-09-14","published":"2025-09-14T12:56:29+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/NAFOApresSki/status/1967209464433684660","reply_tweet_id":"1967209464433684660","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@NAFOApresSki It is a newer word and a combination of &quot;in&quot; plus pathos<br><br>Syn means “along with, together”<br><br>Sympathy is understanding someone&#x27;s feelings and empathy is feeling someone&#x27;s feeling<br><br>What Kirk was doing was throwing shade on the field of psychology as a challenge to God.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1967210847266361542","display_date":"September 14, 2025 · 12:56 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
